# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): as L4_3_band_move_at, day_band's table governing 2027..: the at reads a law-dated band,
# L §4.3 and §8.3 LOAD-LAWDATE `move <m>'s at reads law-dated <x>`. snap12: REFCORE-NOT-YET (the guard).
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input age3: int
input amt: money PLN
input pay_day: date
band day_band(a: int): date

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  at day_band(age3)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

ask q: bal(konto, 2027-12-31)

version v_act
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  day_band: [0, 6) = 2027-03-01 "under 6"
  day_band: [6, 18) = 2027-04-01 "6 to 17"

version v_f
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  age3 = 3 "the age"
  pay_day = 2027-02-01
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2027-01-01 start

version v_amt
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "amt"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LAWDATE move pay's at reads law-dated day_band (m.tally:17)
